{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110402001:1":{"text":"Sir, we'd like to know the fastest way to Mars Peak.","source_cn":"守卫大哥，我们想打听通往战神峰的近路……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA70F11DE427CDB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110402002:1":{"text":"The quickest route is through the back gate of the Sunseek Arena.","source_cn":"最近的路，就是从这道残阳武斗场的后门穿过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x215DE711BFDB6EFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110402002":{"text":"The quickest route is through the back gate of the Sunseek Arena.","source_cn":"最近的路，就是从这道残阳武斗场的后门穿过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x215DE711BFDB6EFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110402003:1":{"text":"I'm sorry, but that's not possible. The Warsong Festival is a major event for the Maulers, and for safety reasons...","source_cn":"抱歉，请诸位理解。战歌节是蛮血的盛事，为了避免治安问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBFE295D845D236E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110402004:1":{"text":"Only those with an official permit can pass through before the event begins.","source_cn":"正式开始前，这里只能经由持有文书的人士通行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x245E09B0CF18EE4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110402005:1":{"text":"How can we obtain a permit?","source_cn":"我们怎么能拿到文书呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC40BAA52E3AC317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110402006:1":{"text":"It's not a simple process. It involves verification and a background check.","source_cn":"手续很麻烦，而且需要审核资格和验证身份。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86382B99C97EB743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110402007:1":{"text":"What? But we don't have time.","source_cn":"什么？可我们必须赶过去，不能延误时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5F3B1F0F4C9CE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110402008:1":{"text":"In that case, you'll need to find another way.","source_cn":"那恐怕你们只能另想办法了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08EEDB153D335CBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110402009:1":{"text":"Please, sir, we're desperate! Could you perhaps turn a blind eye during your lunch break?","source_cn":"那个那个，守卫大哥，打个商量！您在吃午餐的时候，或许可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF6E130CF3DD7D3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110402010:1":{"text":"What's this? Are you questioning the honor of a Mauler warrior?","source_cn":"这是什么意思？你是在质疑一个蛮血战士的尊严吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ED57A2B01116DEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110402011:0":{"text":"...Forgive us, but we really need to get through for our third trial! Please, can you help us?","source_cn":"……抱歉，但我们真的很想快点赶过去！我们需要参加第三道试炼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C70DD655E0C3E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110402012:1":{"text":"So, you're participants? While you still can't use this gate, I know another route to reach the camp on time.","source_cn":"参加试炼的勇士吗？虽然还是不能让你们通过，但是你们经过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA267F913811617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1110402012":{"text":"So, you're participants? While you still can't use this gate, I know another route to reach the camp on time.","source_cn":"参加试炼的勇士吗？虽然还是不能让你们通过，但是你们经过另一条路，也能按时抵达。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA267F913811617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110402013:1":{"text":"Head southeast from the arena.","source_cn":"离开武斗场后，向东南方向进发。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C9010776D9AB661","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Head southeast from the arena.","female":"Head southeast from the arena.","variant_male_record_index":"122474","variant_female_record_index":"122475","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110402014:1":{"text":"That way? But that's the Grimmaw Clan's territory!","source_cn":"那个方向？那里是——黑嚎氏族的领地！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F08A0D2FDB4BD18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110402015:1":{"text":"Not on good terms with the Grimmaw Clan? That's too bad. Unfortunately, it seems that's your only option.","source_cn":"你们有过节？那还真倒霉。但能让你们尽快过去的，只有那条路了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4038F444A721F23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"Please tell us.","source_cn":"请告知我们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDA8C33CB3A3B9C59","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Please tell us.","female":"Please tell us.","variant_male_record_index":"63672","variant_female_record_index":"63673","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"Please open the gate.","source_cn":"请开下门","status":"matched_runtime_gender"